  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danida contract Development of method for calculating funding levels of applications for Strategic Partnerships 2022 &#x2013; 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop a clear methodology for calculating funding levels in the Strategic Partnerships. This includes the design of a calculation method, in close cooperation with MFA, which is aligned with the criteria for assessing and selecting future strategic partners and funding levels. This also includes documenting the process and facilitating an understanding in the MFA of how to use the calculation method.</narrative>
  </description>
